# "When you cycle this card, Cats you control gain hexproof and indestructible until end of turn": cycling the second Basri
# ({2}{W}, discard, draw; CR 702.29a, 603.3) gives the Cat token and the printed Savannah Lions Bot1 controls both keywords
# (CR 205.3m, 702.11, 702.12), but not Basri himself (a Human Knight) and not the Savannah Lions Bot2 controls, so Bot2's Shock
# cannot target Bot1's Cats and can target Basri and Bot2's own Lions.

